# This project has no root-level environment variables of its own.
# Each app manages its own environment file:
#
#   apps/api/.env.example   — backend (database connection, port, etc.)
#   apps/web/.env.example   — frontend (API base URL, etc.)
#
# Copy each of those to a sibling ".env" file in the same folder and fill
# in real values there. Never commit a real ".env" file.
